In [[computer science]], '''bogosort'''<ref name="Fun07"/><ref name="KSFS">{{citation
 | last1 = Kiselyov
 | first1 = Oleg
 | last2 = Shan
 | first2 = Chung-chieh
 | last3 = Friedman
